## 📌 Project Overview

The Python Quiz Game is an interactive command-line application developed as part of the CloudExify Python Internship — Month 2, Project 3.

The game tests the user's Python programming knowledge through multiple-choice questions. Questions are displayed in random order, and the player selects answers using A, B, C, or D.

After completing the quiz, the program calculates the player's score, percentage, grade, and performance feedback. The project also includes a persistent high-score system using a text file.

