## 🧪 Testing

The application was tested for the following scenarios:

### Test 1 — Start Game
The program starts successfully and displays quiz questions.

### Test 2 — Random Questions
Questions appear in a different order when the game is played again.

### Test 3 — Correct Answer
The program displays a correct-answer message and increases the score.

### Test 4 — Wrong Answer
The program displays the correct answer when the selected answer is incorrect.

### Test 5 — Invalid Input
The program rejects invalid input and asks the user to enter A, B, C, or D.

### Test 6 — Final Score
The program correctly calculates the score and percentage.

### Test 7 — Grade
The program assigns a grade according to the final percentage.

### Test 8 — High Score
The program saves and loads the highest score using `highscore.txt`.

### Test 9 — Play Again
The user can start a new quiz after completing the current quiz.

### Test 10 — Exit
The program exits successfully when the user chooses not to play again.

